The optional LaTeX backend downloads the unmodified ZafuThesis.cls from
Stolorzs/ZafuTemplatePublic at commit
81c0d127d485aaaf00c5cbccc5d0d29affd446f2. This external class is not vendored
in this repository and is not covered by its Apache License. An upstream
redistribution license has not been confirmed. Generated source archives
include the class for compilation and UPSTREAM.json for provenance; users
must confirm permission before redistributing those archives.

Optional cover/name images from the same pinned ZafuTemplatePublic revision
are downloaded only when cover or statement pages are explicitly requested.
Their hashes and origins are recorded in UPSTREAM.json; they share the same
unconfirmed upstream redistribution boundary as the class.

The optional BibTeX adapter downloads GB/T 7714 style v2.1.4 from
zepinglee/gbt7714-bibtex-style at commit
f7e42092047bebfdec0d2dedf46b61eab2195fb1 under LPPL 1.3c or later.
Generated projects include the original BST, source, license and
UPSTREAM-BIBTEX.json, plus a separately named school variant with its exact
configuration changes recorded. These external files are not Apache-2.0
materials and are not vendored in this repository.
